[{"id":4575236990,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOFua7Vs8AAAABELSTfg","user":{"login":"warp-for-oss[bot]","id":277970191,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOEJF9Dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3450139?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/warp-for-oss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\nThis PR adds the first editor-backed TUI input model/view and refactors editor layout state to support char-cell soft wrapping. I found several correctness issues in the new TUI path, including dropped text, a CharCell panic path, incomplete kill-range deletion, and missing view invalidation after handled key actions. I did not find security-specific findings in the reviewed diff. The attached spec context says no approved or repository spec context was found.\n\n## Concerns\n- The TUI input's plain-text extraction drops the last real character, so rendering, layout sync, and submitted text are all wrong for basic input.\n- Home/End/Ctrl+A/Ctrl+E in the CharCell path can panic because line-boundary navigation still constructs pixel-based soft-wrap points before calling the CharCell converter.\n- Ctrl+K deletes one character too little at visual line ends because the exclusive deletion range is pre-decremented.\n- Handled key actions that only move the cursor or update scroll offset do not invalidate the TUI view, so navigation can appear frozen until some other redraw occurs.\n- For this user-facing TUI input change, please include screenshots or a screen recording demonstrating it working end to end. The PR description has no visual evidence and says manual testing of `TuiInputView` itself is deferred.\n\n## Verdict\nFound: 0 critical, 5 important, 0 suggestions\n\n**Request changes**\n\nComment `/oz-review` on this pull request to retrigger a review (up to 3 times on the same pull request).\n\n_Powered by [Oz](https://oz.warp.dev)_","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp/pull/13064#pullrequestreview-4575236990","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/13064","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp/pull/13064#pullrequestreview-4575236990"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/13064"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-25T21:45:53Z","commit_id":"f11c29dfdf3290ddefde1642e7817b5bf6542b06"},{"id":4582098747,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOFua7Vs8AAAABER1HOw","user":{"login":"warp-for-oss[bot]","id":277970191,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOEJF9Dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3450139?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/warp-for-oss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warp-for-oss%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\nThis PR adds a char-cell `RenderState` path plus an editor-backed `TuiInputView`, examples, tests, and a milestone tech spec for TUI input.\n\n## Concerns\n- The change is user-facing TUI behavior, but the PR description does not include screenshots or a screen recording demonstrating the input view working end to end. Repo guidance requires visual evidence for UI-impacting changes before merge.\n- The char-cell soft-wrap offset conversion can produce offsets past the buffer end on shorter final lines; see the inline comment.\n- The char-cell layout assumes one Rust `char` equals one terminal cell, which breaks cursor positioning and wrapping for wide or zero-width Unicode; see the inline comment.\n- The input view caches the initial terminal width but does not receive resize updates, so wrapping and cursor math diverge after terminal resizing; see the inline comment.\n\n## Verdict\nFound: 0 critical, 4 important, 0 suggestions\n\n**Request changes**\n\nComment `/oz-review` on this pull request to retrigger a review (up to 3 times on the same pull request).\n\n_Powered by [Oz](https://oz.warp.dev)_","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp/pull/13064#pullrequestreview-4582098747","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/13064","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp/pull/13064#pullrequestreview-4582098747"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/13064"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-26T19:15:24Z","commit_id":"724c54771e2a06766257bc20f0053c6737a7d1b8